      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.15",
      "skos:note": "If the trier of fact is not satisfied that the defendant is guilty of the aggravated offence, but is otherwise satisfied that the defendant is guilty of the corresponding slavery-like offence.",
